{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"元年春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"三月，公會鄭伯于垂，鄭伯以璧假許田。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"夏四月丁未，公及鄭伯盟于越。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"秋，大水。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"元年春，公即位，修好于鄭。鄭人請復祀周公，卒易祊田。公許之。三月，鄭伯以璧假許田，為周公、祊故也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"夏四月丁未，公及鄭伯盟于越，結祊成也。盟曰：「渝盟，無享國。」","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"秋，大水。凡平原出水為大水。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"冬，鄭伯拜盟。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_12_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_12","textTraditional":"宋華父督見孔父之妻于路，目逆而送之，曰：「美而艷。」","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}